    "lawCode": "Amd §§1321 & 1340, Tax L; amd §6, Chap 535 of 1987",
    "lawSection": "Tax Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S3335\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\n\nAn act to amend the tax law and chapter 535 of the laws of 1987,\namending the tax law relating to the city of Yonkers personal income\ntax surcharge, in relation to extending the expiration date of the\npersonal income tax surcharge\n\n\n PURPOSE :\n\nThis bill extends for the personal income tax surcharge in the city of\nYonkers for two additional years.\n\n SUMMARY OF PROVISIONS :\n\nThis bill amends subsection various provisions of the tax law to\nextend the city of Yonkers personal income tax for two additional\nyears.\n\n EXISTING LAW :\n\nUnder current law the city of Yonkers personal income tax surcharge\nexpires September 30, 2009.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\n\nIn order for the City of Yonkers to adopt its Fiscal Year 2009-10\nBudget, the Income Tax Surcharge must be extended since these revenues\nare included in the city of Yonkers 2009-10 budget.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\n\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\n\nThis proposal will preserve $9.9 million in City Fiscal Year 2009-10.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nImmediately.\n",
